      "sequence_position": 1,
      "problem": "$2$ is odd **and** $3$ is prime.\n\nConsider the compound statement above and the following notations:\n\n- $P:2\\text{ is odd}$\n\n- $Q:3\\text{ is prime}$\n\nExpressed in symbolic form, our statement can be written as\n{{field-1}}{{field-2}}{{field-3}}.",
